sequenceDiagram
    actor A as New store owner
    participant ON as Onboarding page
    participant OT as onboardingThunk completeOnboarding
    participant BE as Backend /onboarding/complete
    participant APP as App.jsx
    A->>ON: fill account and store details
    ON->>OT: dispatch(completeOnboarding(data))
    OT->>BE: POST /onboarding/complete
    BE-->>OT: data (user / store details)
    OT-->>ON: isCompleted = true
    ON->>APP: user logs in
    APP->>BE: GET /api/stores/admin
    BE-->>APP: store (PENDING until admin approves)
    APP-->>A: store dashboard once store exists
